abstract: >-
  An exploratory analysis of the 2024 NFCS Investor Survey (n = 2,861) asking
  whether, among respondents with the same number of correct answers on an
  11-item investment knowledge battery, the composition of the remaining
  responses is associated with acceptance of an implausible guaranteed 25%
  annual return. The repository contains the full Stata build and analysis
  pipeline, a Python out-of-sample prediction layer, a measurement-sensitivity
  audit of the auxiliary control, and a curated record of analytical decisions
  including interpretations that were revised or discarded. Not peer reviewed.
